{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNetAndLexicalGraphs","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"API Collection","modules":[{"name":"SwiftNLP"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"WordNet Semantic Hierarchy & Lexical Graphs"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"WordNet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a large lexical database of English where nouns, verbs, adjectives, and adverbs are organized into sets of cognitive synonyms called ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Synsets","type":"text"}]},{"text":", interlinked by conceptual-semantic and lexical relations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"1. Looking Up Synsets & Definitions","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"1-Looking-Up-Synsets--Definitions"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftNLP","","let wordnet = WordNet.shared","","\/\/ Look up all noun synsets for \"bank\"","let synsets = wordnet.synsets(for: \"bank\", pos: .noun)","for s in synsets {","    print(\"ID: \\(s.id), Definition: \\(s.definition)\")","}"]},{"text":"2. Semantic Similarity Metrics","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"2-Semantic-Similarity-Metrics"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftSci implements standard lexical similarity algorithms:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Path Similarity"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Shortest path distance in the hypernym taxonomy:"}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Formula:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sim_path(s1, s2) = 1 \/ (1 + distance(s1, s2))"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wu-Palmer Similarity (WUP)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Measures depth of least common subsumer (LCS) relative to synset depths:"}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Formula:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sim_wup(s1, s2) = (2 · depth(LCS)) \/ (depth(s1) + depth(s2))"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let dog = wordnet.synset(\"dog.n.01\")!","let cat = wordnet.synset(\"cat.n.01\")!","","let pathSim = wordnet.pathSimilarity(dog, cat)","let wupSim = wordnet.wuPalmerSimilarity(dog, cat)","","print(\"Path Similarity: \\(pathSim), Wu-Palmer: \\(wupSim)\")"]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/wordnetandlexicalgraphs"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"WordNet-Types","title":"WordNet Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNet","doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/Synset","doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/POS"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Navigate semantic relationships, compute synset distances, and explore English hypernym\/hyponym trees.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/WordNet":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/wordnet","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WordNet","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"WordNet","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Native WordNet semantic database query engine and concept similarity computer."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WordNet","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNet"},"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/P